d tax reporting", "B": "Nothing in particular", "C": "Only loans", "D": "Only Tier II"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1bh7vucd1l4"}, {"q": "Voluntary extra Tier I contribution gets tax benefit:", "options": {"A": "Under 80CCD(1B) up to Rs. 50,000", "B": "No benefit", "C": "Under 80D", "D": "Double benefit"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qmttualn3aw"}, {"q": "The employer share was raised from 10% to 14% in:", "options": {"A": "2023", "B": "2016", "C": "2019", "D": "2021"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1bq5xtwlosc"}, {"q": "Contributions reflect in the subscriber's:", "options": {"A": "Form 16 only", "B": "Salary slip only", "C": "CRA transaction statement", "D": "Bank passbook"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qcowqzwtlmr"}, {"q": "Which statement is FALSE?", "options": {"A": "Employee pays 10%", "B": "Government pays 14%", "C": "Tier II needs employer matching", "D": "Both shares go to the PRAN"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1zzxeklin7j"}, {"q": "NPS contribution is calculated on:", "options": {"A": "Net salary", "B": "Basic + DA + HRA", "C": "Basic Pay + DA", "D": "Total emoluments"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qa8jo7daq95"}, {"q": "Delay by the nodal office in uploading contributions:", "options": {"A": "Is paid by PFRDA", "B": "Is borne by the subscriber", "C": "Is compensated to the subscriber for the loss", "D": "Has no remedy"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1rcq3jdqgag"}, {"q": "Through eNPS a subscriber can:", "options": {"A": "Take loans", "B": "Only view the account", "C": "Make direct voluntary contributions", "D": "Close the PRAN"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q15qrxontf26"}, {"q": "Tier I contribution by a government employee is:", "options": {"A": "Only for officers", "B": "Optional", "C": "Mandatory at 10% of Basic + DA", "D": "At the employee's choice"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q28zp438oitq"}, {"q": "The combined monthly inflow to the PRAN is:", "options": {"A": "10% of Basic + DA", "B": "20% of Basic + DA", "C": "24% of Basic + DA", "D": "28% of Basic + DA"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1nt1m1r10wy"}, {"q": "The employer contribution does NOT go to:", "options": {"A": "The CRA", "B": "The PRAN", "C": "The employee's savings bank account", "D": "The pension corpus"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qinzt2dqp2f"}]